    // first"). Root cause of a live crash-loop (4 groups/65 profiles: adaptive_ceiling_down hit the OLD floor of 3
    // 129 times in 3h9m, CPU stayed pegged 97-100% the whole time, chrome piled to 121 -> RAM 15% -> hung-window
